# deckrd (micro framework of create specs)
# temp directory: temporary working layer, never tracked
**/temp/
**/tmp/

# session filles
*
!README*
!.gitignore
*kv
*session
*.json

# checklist
**/*checklist.md

## ------------------------------------------------------------ ##
##  Shared notes layer: track workspaces/ only                   ##
## ------------------------------------------------------------ ##
!/workspaces/
!/workspaces/**

## ------------------------------------------------------------ ##
##  Re-exclude: secrets and generated files                      ##
##  Must stay last: these rules undo the broad allow rules above ##
## ------------------------------------------------------------ ##

# temp directory, checklist: re-exclude inside workspaces/
**/temp/
**/tmp/
**/*checklist.md

# .env files
**/.env
**/.env.*

# logs, patches
*.log
*.diff
*.patch

# backup/swap/temp
*~
*.tmp
*.swp
